rong> \u2013 Utilize handguns, flashlights, flares, and defibrillators while scrounging for powerups that enhance your gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Warfare</strong> \u2013 Tricksters can harass, mislead, and terrify their opponents, turning every hallway into a potential trap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Replayable Rounds</strong> \u2013 Quick matches encourage experimentation, laughs, and revenge rematches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for  Parties</strong> \u2013 High chaos, proximity chat, and emergent storytelling create highlight-worthy moments every session.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024440/extras/02b53fbf0722d97234308fadbf121f73.poster.avif?t=1773455829\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024440/extras/02b53fbf0722d97234308fadbf121f73.webm?t=1773455829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024440/extras/02b53fbf0722d97234308fadbf121f73.mp4?t=1773455829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["autotroph games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024440/77c68d562d179716f902e97d1a810881c934922f/header.jpg?t=1773455829","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto